  m_Name: Citadel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Stage::Game.Stage.Config.LevelAsset
  _title: Siege of the Citadel
  _scene: Citadel
  _briefing: 'A frost colossus, bound by dark magic, marches on the Circle''s citadel
    with a horde at its feet. Ice cannot touch it and its hide turns steel. The road
    winds back and forth below the walls: build where the lanes run side by side
    and wear the giant down with every other reaction you know before it reaches
    the gate.'
  _victory: The colossus crumbles at the foot of the citadel. The realm will remember
    the Architect who held the line.
  _gold: 350
  _lives: 20
  _rest: 14
